# My investing context

Copy this file to `config/context.md` and edit freely. Claude reads it on
every daily run and every ad-hoc question, so the more specific the
better.

## Goals and horizon
- Long-term (5+ years), dividend + growth.

## Risk tolerance
- Moderate. No margin. Max single-position 10% of portfolio.

## Current holdings
- AAPL (~30%)
- MSFT (~15%)
- Cash ~20%

## Sector views
- Overweight: AI infrastructure, cybersecurity.
- Underweight: consumer discretionary.

## Hard nos
- Tobacco, gambling.
- Any stock with < $1B market cap.

## Notes to the agent
- Prefer ideas with clear catalysts in the next 3 months.
- Flag earnings within 7 days in watchlist updates.
- Keep messages short — I read on my phone.
